@startuml uc001-ssd
!include ../../../diagrams/style.iuml
title UC-001 Configure model connections: system sequence diagram

actor Developer
participant "JudgeLab" as System
actor "Model provider" as Provider

note over Developer, System
  Triggered by a run (UC-006), or by a test
  that builds a connector directly.
end note

Developer -> System : configure connections(target profile, judge profile)
loop for each profile (target, judge)
  System -> System : validate profile(provider, model, api_key_env,\nbase_url, timeout_s, max_retries, options)
  System -> System : choose connector(provider)
  System -> System : resolve credential(api_key_env)
end
alt every profile is valid and every key is set
  System --> Developer : a connector for the target and one for the judge
else 2a, 3a, 3b: a profile is wrong
  System --> Developer : profile error "connection 'target': ..." listing every problem
else 4a: the key variable is missing or blank
  System --> Developer : auth error naming the variable, never its value
end

== later, for each prompt (UC-003, UC-004) ==

System -> Provider : model request(prompt, instructions, model)
alt the model answers or refuses
  Provider --> System : answer or refusal, served model, usage, request id
  System -> System : record response(text or refusal, requested and served model,\nfinish reason, truncated, token counts, request id)
else 5a, 6b: the call fails or the reply cannot be trusted
  Provider --> System : HTTP error, timeout or unusable reply
  System -> System : raise connector error(kind, HTTP status, request id)
end
@enduml
